CFG555 analysis (FROZEN_CRITERIA.md): the CFG361 growth statistic (sigma8 ratio; max|P/P_S0 - 1| for k <= 1 h/Mpc; FAIL / GROWTH OK / TENSION)
Statistic: CFG361 cuts (FAIL |s8-1| > 0.20; GROWTH OK |s8-1| <= 0.05 and max|P-1|(k<=1) <= 0.10; else TENSION), vs each lane's matched S0 JSON.
Gravitating density delta_grav = -k^2 phi_k / (1.5 Om) from the engine's own forces on the saved z = 0 state (particles + (e - comp)/(1.5 Om)).

C1 synthetic source (P_syn = 0.05 P_S0, fixed amplitude) recovered bin by bin: max rel 2.9e-07 (<= 1e-5) -> PASS
C2 capture on S0: max|grav - p| / peak 1.9e-07 (<= 1e-4); (1 + 0.05) delta injected -> P ratio dev from 1.1025 5.3e-07 (<= 1e-5) -> PASS

Per run (z = 0).  particle = the lanes' field; grav = the gravitating field.  C0 = |recomputed particle - committed| (s8 / max|P-1|).
